  "definitions": {
    "ResetMessageOffsetReq": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "topic": {
          "description": "Topic名称。",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "partition": {
          "description": "分区编号,默认值为-1,若传入值为-1,则重置所有分区。",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "message_offset": {
          "description": "重置消费进度到指定偏移量。\n- 如果传入offset小于当前最小的offset,则重置到最小的offset。\n- 如果大于最大的offset,则重置到最大的offset。\n\n**message_offset、timestamp二者必选其一。**",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int64"
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "description": "重置消费进度到指定时间,格式为unix时间戳,单位为毫秒。\n- 如果传入timestamp早于当前最早的timestamp,则重置到最早的timestamp。\n- 如果晚于最晚的timestamp,则重置到最晚的timestamp。\n\n**message_offset、timestamp二者必选其一。**",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int64"
        }
      },
